  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.8.1-beta.2`\n\n### Features\n\n- remember the main window's size, position and maximized state, so a quit, restart or update reopens it where it was left; bounds are taken once the window settles, so a maximize animation no longer overwrites the place it un-maximizes to, and a window left on an unplugged monitor opens centered on the main one ([1cb1d050](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/1cb1d0501fabdf67041405cf7a253cc4b057c2af))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.8.1-beta.2...v0.8.1-beta.3](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.8.1-beta.2...v0.8.1-beta.3)",
